.TH KINTSUGI-RULES 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-rules \- rule file management
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi rules
scan
.br
.B kintsugi rules
import [\-\-apply]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Find and import rule files (AGENTS.md, .clinerules, .cursor rules).
.SH COMMANDS
.IP \fBscan\fR
Find existing rule files
.IP \fBimport\fR
Report only; --apply writes the inherited layer
.SH OPTIONS
.IP \fB\-\-apply\fR
Write the inherited layer
.SH EXAMPLES
Scan for rules:
.PP
  $ kintsugi rules scan
.PP
Import rules:
.PP
  $ kintsugi rules import --apply
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1)
